Z||000009||DXR_DAD||02-21-2000||08:05 PM||||William, the spoiler is after market for a 450SL, with on center mount. Yes the curvatures are Different, and unique! It has a new wing on it now thanks to Super X.  Glad all of you guys like my little plastic toy.<P>Thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
